# parse/idle (id 66): formula lexer between tokens. RDOK = 0: fetch char I. Otherwise dispatch on char:
# space skip; digit -> lnum PC 1 (re-read); '.' -> lnum PC 2; letter or '$' -> lword (re-read, TV = I,
# the word start for a sheet prefix); apostrophe -> shpack 121 PC 1 (quoted sheet name, X0 = I + 1,
# X2 = 1); '"' -> lstr; '#' -> lerr; '<' '>' -> lcmp; + - * / ^ & = % ( , ) and end of text -> parse
# (73) with TK, TO (comma TO 32 for the union operator); any other char -> reject (79, STATUS 1).
# Intersection: SPC (word 28) = a space was skipped while E = 0. At a letter, '$', apostrophe or '('
# with SPC = 1 and E = 0, hand parse TK 4, TO 33 without consuming the char. Note: weights/parse/idle.md
